# unused-variable (SCR102)

Local variable is never used

- Category: Scripts (`SCR`)
- Default severity: warning
- Enabled by default: yes
- Fix: always

## What it does

Reports unused local variables.

## Options

Set in `[rules.SCR102]`.

| Option | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ignore-names` | array of strings | `[]` | Names never reported. |
| `dummy-pattern` | string | `"^_"` | Regex of names that may be unused. |
